Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 23:58:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] fix: settle records/rates for disconnected players,
 idempotently (P1)

Root cause: finish handler resolved players via live sockets, so a player who
disconnected (and was disqualified) was skipped; the remaining player stayed ACTIVE
and nobody's rate changed. Also finish could fire twice (disconnect grace timer).

- GameManager keeps token->userId independent of sockets; finish notified once per game
- settlement.ts: pure result resolution (1v1: ACTIVE vs decided -> complement; tie = draw)
- settleGame.ts: DB-injected, idempotent (existing record ids skipped; rate only for new rows)
- tests incl. real GameManager disconnect->grace->finish flow with mock timers
