From: QuizSpark Dev <dev@quizspark.local>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 00:00:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] fix(security): CSRF/origin checks, rate limits, socket
 input hardening (P2)

- csrfGuard: reject state-changing requests from non-allowed Origin (cookie sessions use SameSite=None)
- Socket.IO allowRequest: Origin check on the WebSocket handshake (CORS does not cover it)
- ALLOWED_ORIGINS env (defaults unchanged); COOKIE_SAMESITE env; httpOnly explicit; OAuth state=true
- express-rate-limit: general / write / contact / report limiters; per-socket event limiter
- socket handlers: wrap in safe() (a non-string answer or null settings previously threw and could crash the process)
- sanitizeSettings(): validate host-supplied game settings
- sync-state only for room members (was: any client could subscribe to any room)
- security headers, x-powered-by off
